# Repositories in this workspace, consumed by workspace-bootstrap.
# Format: name|origin-url   (# comments and blank lines ignored)
#
# Copy to repos.list and edit, or generate from an existing workspace:
#   workspace-bootstrap --snapshot
#
# repos.list is untracked on purpose: it is machine/team specific.
# Tip: repos whose tooling pushes from headless sessions should use HTTPS
# remotes (gh credential helper works without an ssh-agent).
repo-a|git@github.com:your-org/repo-a.git
repo-b|git@github.com:your-org/repo-b.git
repo-c|https://github.com/your-org/repo-c.git
